# Without the cursor predicate, every page is the first page and the rest of the
# chart cannot be reached.

title: the page cursor is bound and then ignored
file: internal/ledger/balance.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestFollowingNextReachesEveryAccountOnceAndStops -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
		    AND (nullif($3::text, '') IS NULL OR code > $3::text)
--- after
		    AND (nullif($3::text, '') IS NULL OR true)
